{"variant": "compliance", "year": 2001, "month": 4, "day": 20, "slug": "vendor-contract-renewal-3345", "variant_int": 2, "html": "<section class=\"page-banner\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"text-uppercase mb-1\" style=\"color:var(--gold);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:.75rem\"><a href=\"/archive/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">Archive</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2001/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">2001</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2001/04/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">04</a> &rsaquo; 20</p><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:.72rem;margin-bottom:.4rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Compliance Review &bull; EHS-2001-Q4-5859</p><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25\">Compliance Due Diligence Report — Vendor Contract Renewal</h1><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:0\">Antiviral Development &bull; Medalist Advisory Partners &bull; Archived 2001-04-20</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:3rem 0;background:var(--surface)\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\"><div id=\"acpwb-compliance-87a558af-header\" style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid var(--gold);padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem\">Document Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.3rem .8rem;font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem\"><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Client</span><br><strong>Medalist Advisory Partners</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Industry</span><br><strong>Antiviral Development</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Audit Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">EHS-2001-Q4-5859</code></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Version</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">2.2</code></div></div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\">Filed by <strong>Keiko Sokolov</strong>, Practice Director, Workforce Analytics &mdash; <a href=\"mailto:keiko.sokolov@acpwb.com\" style=\"color:var(--navy)\">keiko.sokolov@acpwb.com</a></div><div style=\"margin-top:.6rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.3rem\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;padding:.15rem .45rem;background:#f4f6f9;border:1px solid #dde1e8;color:#444\">OECD Guidelines for Multinational Enterprises</span><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;padding:.15rem .45rem;background:#f4f6f9;border:1px solid #dde1e8;color:#444\">UK Gender Pay Gap Information Regulations 2017</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">1. Engagement Scope</h5><p style=\"font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333\">This compliance assessment was initiated as part of Medalist Advisory Partners&#x27;s pre-transaction due diligence for a planned acquisition in the Antiviral Development sector. The scope covers 77 material compensation and benefits programs across 5 legal entities, focusing on potential liabilities and integration risks.</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">2. Methodology</h5><p style=\"font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333\">ACPWB conducted a series of structured interviews with 77 key process owners across HR, Payroll, and Legal to map the end-to-end OECD Guidelines for Multinational Enterprises; UK Gender Pay Gap Information Regulations 2017 compliance process. Process maps were validated with management and used to identify potential control gaps.</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">3. Findings Summary</h5><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Finding ID</th><th>Risk</th><th>Status</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">EHS-9521-001</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">OPEN</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Director of Cloud Strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2001-07-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">WARN Act notification timeline not met for 77 affected employees in 5 reduction-in-force</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">EHS-8441-002</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">DEFERRED</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Director of Financial Planning &amp; Analysis</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2001-06-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Fair Credit Reporting Act (FCRA) pre-adverse action notices not provided to 77 candidates</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">EHS-1441-003</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">DEFERRED</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Director of Client Success</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2001-08-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">ADA interactive process not documented for 77 accommodation requests reviewed during the period</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">EHS-8654-004</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">IN PROGRESS</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Associate, Research &amp; Analytics</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2001-07-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Annual merit increase administration varied by &gt;13% across comparable job families</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">EHS-7351-005</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#eff6ff;color:#1d4ed8;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">MONITORING</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Director of Content Strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2001-08-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">UK Gender Pay Gap report for 2001 uses incorrect methodology for calculating quartiles</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">4. Detailed Findings</h5><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">EHS-9521-001</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">WARN Act notification timeline not met for 77 affected employees in 5 reduction-in-force</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">A cross-functional team from HR, IT, and Legal will be established to own and maintain the company&#x27;s GDPR Record of Processing Activities, with updates required for any new system or process.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Management has implemented the primary corrective action. We are now in a monitoring phase to ensure the new process is operating effectively. We will provide a final report after 90 days of monitoring.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Director of Cloud Strategy</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2001-07-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">EHS-8441-002</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Fair Credit Reporting Act (FCRA) pre-adverse action notices not provided to 77 candidates</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The HRIS will be audited and reconfigured to ensure FMLA leave entitlement calculations are 100% compliant with the &quot;rolling 12-month period measured backward&quot; method.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">The identified control weakness has been contained through the implementation of a temporary manual workaround. A permanent, automated control is in development with a target implementation date of Q4 2003.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Director of Financial Planning &amp; Analysis</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2001-06-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">EHS-1441-003</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">ADA interactive process not documented for 77 accommodation requests reviewed during the period</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">A cross-functional team from HR, IT, and Legal will be established to own and maintain the company&#x27;s GDPR Record of Processing Activities, with updates required for any new system or process.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Management has performed a cost-benefit analysis and determined that the cost of full remediation exceeds the potential risk exposure. We have implemented mitigating controls and formally accepted the residual risk.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Director of Client Success</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2001-08-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">EHS-8654-004</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Annual merit increase administration varied by &gt;13% across comparable job families</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The company website and all subsidiary career sites will be updated to include a compliant &quot;Your Privacy Choices&quot; link, and a dedicated internal team will be trained to handle data subject requests.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">The finding is acknowledged. This issue was caused by a temporary system outage on 2001-04-20. The system has been restored, and the backlog of affected transactions has been cleared. We consider this matter closed.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Associate, Research &amp; Analytics</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2001-07-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">EHS-7351-005</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">UK Gender Pay Gap report for 2001 uses incorrect methodology for calculating quartiles</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">All HR and benefits personnel shall complete mandatory HIPAA training. The IT department will implement technical safeguards (e.g., email encryption) to protect all outbound transmissions of PHI.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">We agree with the finding. A request for proposal (RFP) has been issued to select a vendor to assist with the implementation of the corrective action. The vendor selection is expected to be complete by 2001-04-20.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Director of Content Strategy</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2001-08-28</strong></div></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:1.5rem;padding-top:1.25rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between\"><a href=\"/archive/2001/04/19/intercompany-reconciliation-and-settlement-report-9905/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2001/04/20/vendor-contract-renewal-3345/capital-allocation-framework-8124/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.7rem\">Audit Record</div><dl class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:.82rem\"><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Audit Ref</dt><dd class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.7\">EHS-2001-Q4-5859</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Date</dt><dd class=\"fw-700 mb-2\">2001-04-20</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Organization</dt><dd class=\"fw-700 mb-2\">Medalist Advisory Partners</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Findings</dt><dd class=\"mb-2\">5 total</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Record ID</dt><dd class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.7\">87a558af</dd></dl></div><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.7rem\">Navigation</div><ul c